      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables\n    purchase_price = 40\n    sale_price = 55\n    shares = 200\n    discount = 0.15\n    holding_period = 1.5\n\n    # Calculate the discounted purchase price and total gain\n    discounted_purchase_price = purchase_price * (1 - discount)\n    total_gain = (sale_price - discounted_purchase_price) * shares\n\n    # Shares held less than two years have the full gain treated as ordinary income\n    taxable_income = total_gain if holding_period < 2 else discount * purchase_price * shares\n\n    # Return taxable income rounded to the nearest dollar\n    return round(taxable_income)\n```",
